[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6841.189, "timestamp": "01:54:01", "text": "主要的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6844.55, "timestamp": "01:54:04", "text": "然后我意识到，是的，我可以做到。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6847.91, "timestamp": "01:54:07", "text": "只是你的……嗯，是的。你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6849.669, "timestamp": "01:54:09", "text": "现在动力和其他一切都很重要。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6852.149, "timestamp": "01:54:12", "text": "环境至关重要。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6855.03, "timestamp": "01:54:15", "text": "是的。是的。感觉就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6858.31, "timestamp": "01:54:18", "text": "对我来说，这是一个新的账户或新的开始。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6861.27, "timestamp": "01:54:21", "text": "因为我当时太……所以才这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6863.91, "timestamp": "01:54:23", "text": "此账户的专业人士"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6865.669, "timestamp": "01:54:25", "text": "好像所有事情都必须完美似的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6868.149, "timestamp": "01:54:28", "text": "内容、视频、音乐都必须完美无瑕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6871.83, "timestamp": "01:54:31", "text": "那种东西。但当我说“是”的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6874.229, "timestamp": "01:54:34", "text": "我们现在都是从某个地方开始的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6876.47, "timestamp": "01:54:36", "text": "我就是这样创建了第二个频道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6879.51, "timestamp": "01:54:39", "text": "嗯，这有助于理解。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6882.79, "timestamp": "01:54:42", "text": "是的，如果我有的话，我可以这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6885.47, "timestamp": "01:54:45", "text": "意志和动机"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6888.47, "timestamp": "01:54:48", "text": "一切，嗯，如果……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6890.35, "timestamp": "01:54:50", "text": "这也适用于我，比如如果我输了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6893.27, "timestamp": "01:54:53", "text": "所有的一切我都愿意重做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6896.149, "timestamp": "01:54:56", "text": "再来一次，或者做得更好，"}]